WEBVTT

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.050
My name's Kise Yayoi.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:12.250
I'm a bit of a crybaby, but my heart's always been set on drawing.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.930
But it's kind of embarrassing when other people see my stuff.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.050
What're you drawing, Yayoi-chan?

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:34.850
No! Don't look!

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:36.440
You're damn good!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.290
You really are!

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.370
Ain't no reason ta hide that!

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.950
I'd be proud if that was my art!

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.420
Would you mind allowing us to take a closer look?

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.260
That's fantastic!

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.900
Sure is!

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.260
Who's the chick, anyway?

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:01.800
Umm, well... she's a superheroine I came up with.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.140
You came up with that yourself?!

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.910
You could mistake it for the work of a professional Manga artist.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.380
You... really think so?

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:12.110
Yeah! You're really talented, Yayoi-chan!

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.780
You could be a Manga artist one day!

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.990
Me, a Manga artist...?

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.530
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.370
Smile Precure!

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:24.270
Let's go!

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.810
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:26.940
All together!

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.540
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.740
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:33.410
Smile Precure!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.250
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:43.690
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:48.890
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:54.830
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:59.770
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:59.170 --> 00:01:59.740
So bright!

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:04.940
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:11.380
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:11.880
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.050
Let's go!

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:15.760
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.690
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:23.500
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.060
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.730
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:26.870
Everybody!

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:31.070
Fly to the future!

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.570
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.740
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.050
Smile Precure!

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.620
Me, a Manga artist...

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.980
Ain't most Manga writers really popular nowadays?

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.950
Really good Mangas get made into TV shows and movies, too!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.410
And you'll always be held in the highest regard!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.660
Yeah, but I think that's a bit beyond me...

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.930
Why's that?

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.760
It's not easy making it in the Mangas industry, you know!

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.140
Not everyone has the talent needed to go pro.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.160
Well, sure, but...

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.350
You're drawing a Manga, Kise?

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:15.130
You should enter this Manga competition, then.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.600
Competition?

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.010
Yeah.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.780
You've got the skills to do well, I bet.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.410
The New Artist Awards...

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.820
It couldn't hurt to try, right?

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:30.620
Yeah! And gimme your autograph if you do go pro!

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:33.160
Yeah, I'll want one too!

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.380
Maybe I should give it a try...

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:38.960
I'm gonna enter this competition!

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.940
Okay, let's put pen to paper!

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.380
But what should it be about...?

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:19.730
You can do it, Yayoi-chan!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.230
It's settled!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:25.770
I can do this!

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.380
Wow, Yayoi-chan!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:35.750
That's super good!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.620
Keep it down, guys, jeez! You're embarrassing me!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.540
That's great for one night's work!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:43.090
I'm eagerly awaiting its completion!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.060
It's nothing special, really...

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.260
So, can we read it?

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.660
Well, I've only done the cover so far...

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.400
What, that's it?

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.210
Man, I wanted to read it...

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:59.140
I'll get it done soon, I promise!

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:01.500
You gonna make the deadline?

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.810
I'm sure I'll find a way, don't worry!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.440
Yeah, Yayoi-chan! If anyone can do it, you can!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.340
Good luck!

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.350
Thanks!

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.990
You didn't think you could escape me, did you?!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.530
Dead end, girl.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:29.000
I've heard all about your plans for world domination, vile fiend!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.200
I figured as much.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.100
Prepare to die!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.010
What?!

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.500
Evil will not escape my clutches!

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:01.600
Warrior of Justice, Miracle Peace to the rescue!

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:09.910
Wow, it's late...

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.980
I didn't get much more done tonight, either...

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:22.320
<i>How am I gonna pull this off? This is too much work for me alone...</i>

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:26.190
<i>Maybe I over-estimated myself...</i>

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.840
<i>No... I said I'd do it, so I will!</i>

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.440
Kise-san.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.210
Kise-san!

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:31.210
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.300
Kise-san!

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:33.250
Yes, Miss?!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.170
Stop spacing out and read from the textbook, please.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:37.200
R-Right!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.070
Page 82.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.190
Sorry, Miss!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.680
Yayoi-chan!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.880
Oh, hi!

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.750
Let us help you with your Manga!

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.830
That's what friends are for, right?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.850
Professional Manga artists always have assistants, right?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.680
If we can be of any assistance, please let us help you.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.840
I'll help too-kuru!

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.480
Guys.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.170
Thanks.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.080
But...

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:13.340
I've gotta do this myself.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.070
But...

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.310
I'll be fine!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:18.780
It might not be easy, but...

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.680
...I bet that's what Miracle Peace would do.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:27.140
Is that the name of your character, Yayoi-san?

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.040
Yeah.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:32.990
I was always a bit of a crybaby, even when I was a kid.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:37.330
So I conjured up this strong, empowering heroine, and drew pictures of her.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.380
And that's Miracle Peace?

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.400
Yeah.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.580
So Miracle Peace is an idealized version of yourself, then, Yayoi-san?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:46.540
Right.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.640
I know it's gonna be a lot of work drawing this Manga.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.920
And I'm really glad you guys wanna help!

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:58.010
But I think I'm the only one who can put her story on paper.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.320
So I want to do this myself.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.180
Yayoi-chan...

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:06.460
Very well. Then the least we can do is support you from afar.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.960
Thanks, guys!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:20.740
What'd you call me out here for, Joker-oni?

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.100
Akaoni-san.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:29.310
I'm amazed you can be so complacent, considering your inability to defeat a single one of the Precure.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.810
Wh-What did you say-oni?!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.530
King Pierrot is most displeased with you.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.090
H-He is?!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:38.560
Even with your clinical incompetence, I expect you should be capable of at least one thing:

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:41.730
Defeating that little crybaby Cure Peace, yes?

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:50.800
Am I understood? Because this is your last chance.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.950
My last...?

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.970
Fine then-oni!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.240
Cure Peace...

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.180
I'm going to beat you to a pulp <i>this time-oni!</i>

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.520
Let us hope you do.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:16.520
Peace!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.520
Peace!

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:51.940
What on earth?!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:01.280
Seems like you were no match for me without anyone to help you!

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:03.810
Miracle Peace!

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.820
You're next, brat.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:11.590
You seriously think <i>you</i> can become a Manga artist?

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.900
Don't you get it yet?!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:18.160
You're a crybaby who can't do anything by herself!

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:21.430
You'll just quit before you finish — like you always do!

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:25.070
Life doesn't always have a happy end like your Mangas!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.900
Just give up now!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.020
Miracle Peace!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.190
Your story can't end here...

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:46.710
Hah! You're nothing but one of her pathetic little delusions.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:51.560
You have no power, Miracle Peace! You're just a story!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:54.130
There's no way I'll give in to you!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.400
Miracle Peace!

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:10.200
Just a dream...

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:25.860
You seriously think <i>you</i> can become a Manga artist?

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:33.300
Ain't most Manga writers really popular nowadays?

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.710
You'll always be held in the highest regard!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.470
Yeah, Yayoi-chan! If anyone can do it, you can!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.850
Good luck!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.500
Hey, Yayoi-chan!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.660
We got ya some snacks!

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.100
Guys...

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.290
What's wrong?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:03.200
Wait, did you finish your Manga?!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.930
I'm so sorry...

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:13.140
but I can't... I can't do this!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.320
Yayoi-chan!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:16.470
Yayoi-san!

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.020
There you are-oni!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.840
Cure Peace!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.610
I'm gonna crush you into the ground-oni!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:00.220
What do I do...? I can't fight him alone!

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.960
Huh? What's that you've got there-oni?

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:13.370
No! Give me back my Manga!

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:16.640
I'll give it back... if you can beat me-oni!

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:22.980
<i>I don't think I can... no... what would Miracle Peace do?</i>

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.060
Ready?

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.520
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.540
Go!

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:36.340
Go, go!

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.940
Let's Go: Peace!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:03.790
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:06.880
Cure Peace!

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:11.610
Come on out, Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.380
Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.560
My Manga!

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:29.550
You and me, right now-oni!

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.350
And this time, I'm gonna win-oni!

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.010
Akan...

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:42.360
...be!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.730
Akan!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:54.300
I knew it! You can't beat me alone-oni!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.080
Life's not as kind as your stupid Mangas-oni!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:02.250
Miracle Peace-oni? What a joke-oni!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.940
No it's not!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:09.650
Miracle Peace is my heroine! I look up to her...

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:11.620
She's everything I want to be!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.360
Akanbe!

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:25.130
You look up to the heroine of your own Manga?!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:27.050
That's so dumb it's funny-oni!

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:31.580
That makes her the delusion of little wimp-oni!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.710
And now, you die-oni!

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.030
There's no way I'll give in to you!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.200
Miracle Peace isn't just some delusion!

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:58.280
I'm going to finish her story...

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.670
I'm going to do what I set out to do!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.980
Tough talk coming from the girl who was gonna throw it away-oni!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.900
Don't you get it yet-oni?!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.850
You're a crybaby who can't do anything by herself-oni!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.950
You'll just quit before you finish — like you always do-oni!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.120
Maybe you're right...

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:22.960
I know I can be a crybaby... who can't do anything by herself...

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:28.470
So I created Miracle Peace — a strong heroine like in my favorite Mangas!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:33.040
You see-oni?! She's just your own little fantasy-oni!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:36.810
No she's not! She exists... <i>inside me!</i>

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:42.680
That little bit of strength deep in my heart is Miracle Peace!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:50.290
I love to draw, and write Mangas! And as long as I have that passion inside me...

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:52.420
...I will never, <i>ever</i> give up!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.150
You've got some nerve for a little crybaby-oni!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:23.920
But I'll show you just how weak you are compared to me-oni!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.480
This is your last chance.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:00.550
Precure...

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:16.690
Peace Thunder...

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.880
Hurricane!

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:46.250
You see now...? Please... just give me back my Manga!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:55.360
There's no going back for me now-oni...!

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.550
Take this-oni!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:14.500
Guys!

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:15.970
Sorry we're late, Peace!

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:19.800
Akaoni! Peace is stronger than ya could ever be!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.210
And she's got guts that put us all to shame!

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:26.180
We know that Peace has the strength to pull through!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:35.840
I know that there'll always be times I want to give it all up...

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:40.960
But once I've put my mind to something, I'll always see it through!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.430
Peace...

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:46.460
Girls!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:47.570
Okay!

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:51.540
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.600
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.050
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.300
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:09.860
Precure...

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:13.260
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.700
Burst!

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:27.730
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:34.310
That's another new Décor-kuru!

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.300
I... I lost-oni...

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:42.450
What's going to happen to me now-oni...?

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.340
You did it, Yayoi-chan!

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:55.120
Just watch, guys! I'm gonna finish this Manga no matter what!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.470
We know you can do it, Yayoi-chan!

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:14.120
Congrats on finishing your Manga, Yayoi-chan!

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:16.750
Thanks!

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:24.040
Take this! Miracle Peace Thunder Hurricane!

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:27.560
Curse you, Miracle Peace!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.530
This rocks, Yayoi!

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:32.120
You haven't pulled any punches, Yayoi-chan! This is great!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.010
You've truly poured your heart into this.

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:37.480
I'm amazed you did this all yourself!

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:40.770
Thanks, guys... I couldn't have done it without you!

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:45.340
My name's Kise Yayoi.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:52.550
I'm a bit of a crybaby, but once I set my mind to something, I'll always see it through to the end!

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.670
Guess what, everyone? I'm about to have a new sibling!

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:44.940
Wait, your parents are expecting another kid?!

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:46.120
Wow!

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:46.830
A new little brother...

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:47.760
Or sister!

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:48.990
The miracle of life!

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:52.500
Keita, Haru, Hina, Yuuta, Kouta, and now...

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:53.860
Oh, I just can't wait!

00:23:54.220 --> 00:23:56.470
